{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/steam_page_gif4-1.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the portals of the Mystic Woods to defeat hordes of enemies threatening the Kingdom of the Holy Slime. But don\u2019t worry\u2014you won\u2019t face these battles alone. <strong>Your cute, tiny, yet battle-ready companion will support you on your mission.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/sessions.png?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/steam_page_gif3.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jump into 10-minute sessions and fight for survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/build.png?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/steam_page_gif5.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose from over 40 items to create the best possible build and keep the monster hordes at bay.</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/slimes.png?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/short3.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock and choose from 13 companions throughout the game. Each one comes with a unique ability.</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/coop.png?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/steam_page_gif7.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel the world solo or together. All you need is one keyboard\u2014but gamepad support is also included.</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/worlds.png?t=1748887152\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/steam_page_gif9.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 90 different enemies across 10 unique worlds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/achievements.png?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/steam_page_gif10.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn over 30 (12 in this demo) achievements that unlock both in-game and on Steam!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/vampires.png?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/steam_page_gif8.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yes, this game includes vampires.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Slime Cave Visitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3770170/b53a538fa341e1b036b9ae91344e929d5202f89d.jpg"},{"name":"Slime Cave Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3770170/d66314de0a86f69ec5381f405b2b629757251e21.jp