0170/extras/short3.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock and choose from 13 companions throughout the game. Each one comes with a unique ability.</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/coop.png?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/steam_page_gif7.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel the world solo or together. All you need is one keyboard\u2014but gamepad support is also included.</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/worlds.png?t=1748887152\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/steam_page_gif9.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 90 different enemies across 10 unique worlds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/achievements.png?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/steam_page_gif10.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn over 30 (12 in this demo) achievements that unlock both in-game and on Steam!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/vampires.png?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770170/extras/steam_page_gif8.gif?t=1748887152\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yes, this game includes vampires.</strong></p>","developers":["Chrio Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3